{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"弥迦书","commonName":"弥迦书","title":"弥迦书","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"2f452e45ab0a57cd41ee90eea1e3a317e2fb9fa13c9d1eb63e3a525aa69770b1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["欺压者的命运"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"躺在床上图谋不轨、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盘算作恶的人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天一亮，他们就依仗手中的权势行恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们贪图田地，就去霸占；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"想要房屋，就去抢夺。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们欺压人的全家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诈取别人的产业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我正计划降灾惩罚你们这族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们无法逃脱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不能趾高气扬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这是你们灾祸临头的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，人们要唱悲戚的哀歌讥讽你们说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我们彻底完了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华把我们的产业转给别人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂竟拿走我们的产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把田地分给掳掠我们的人。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他们在耶和华的会众中将无人抽签分地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"他们的先知说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“不要说预言了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要预言这种事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们不会蒙受羞辱。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家啊，你们怎能说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华已经不耐烦了吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂会做这些事吗？”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我的话岂不有益于行为正直的人吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"近来，你们像仇敌一样起来攻击我的子民","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们剥去那些如从战场归来一样毫无戒备的过路人的外衣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们把我子民中的妇女从她们的幸福家园赶走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又从她们的子女身上永远地夺去我的尊荣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们起来走吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这里不再是你们的安居之地！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这里已遭玷污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被彻底毁坏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倘若有骗子撒谎说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我预言你们会有美酒佳酿。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他就会成为这个民族的先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“雅各家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把你们都聚集起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把以色列的余民集合起来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要将他们安顿在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像羊圈里的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如草场上的羊群；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那里必人声鼎沸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"开路者要走在他们前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带领他们冲出敌人的城门。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的王走在前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华亲自引导他们。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“你们像仇敌一样起来攻击我的子民”或译“我的子民如仇敌一样兴起来”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}